    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Due to the high level of interest in this property, please do not call.\r\n\r\nHenry Wiltshire Estate Agents are delighted to bring No. 16 Oakglade Court to the rental market.\r\n\r\nThis well-presented first-floor two-bedroom apartment, extending to approximately 70 sq. m., is situated in a secure gated development just off the Blessington Road in Naas.\r\n\r\nThe apartment is offered part furnished and provides bright and comfortable accommodation throughout. The property comprises a spacious living area, fully fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from a private ensuite, and a main bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property further benefits from private parking within the gated development.\r\n\r\nOakglade Court is conveniently located just off the Blessington Road, within easy reach of Naas town centre and its selection of shops, restaurants, cafés and local amenities.\r\n\r\nProperty Features\r\n\r\nTwo double bedrooms\r\n\r\nMaster bedroom with ensuite\r\n\r\nFirst-floor apartment\r\n\r\nApproximately 70 sq. m.\r\n\r\nPart furnished\r\n\r\nElectric heating\r\n\r\nBER Rating: D1\r\n\r\nSecure gated development\r\n\r\nPrivate parking\r\n\r\nConvenient location just off the Blessington Road\r\n\r\nClose to Naas town centre\r\n\r\nExcellent access to local amenities and transport links\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment through Henry Wiltshire Estate Agents."
      },
